# Mike's UI (library)

Addon `MikesUI`, GUID `B3F91C6A4E275D08`, depends on Arma Reforger `58D0FB3206B6F859`. Consumers add that GUID to their `addon.gproj`. **Do not edit this repo to add a feature menu.** Subclass `MUI_MenuBase` in the consuming addon. In-tree demo: `MUI_SampleMenu`.

Every `Scripts/Game/**/*.c` file has a Consumer / Layout / Extend header. Read it. Full guide: `README.md`.

## Enforce

No ternary. Every `new` in a `ref` (member, local, or `ref array<ref T>`). Missing `ref` → GC → NULL in `AddChild`. Colors: `Color.FromSRGBA`. Paint: `DrawX/Y`, `GetDrawOpacity()`. Call `super` unless replacing.

## Theme

Per `MUI_Runtime`. `runtime.SetTheme(MUI_ThemeData.CreateUplink())` **before** `Create*` / `Adopt`. Controls paint via `GetTheme()`. `MUI_Theme` statics remain the uplink defaults. No hot-swap after `SetRoot` in 0.2.0.

## Menus

```
class MyMenu : MUI_MenuBase
{
  protected ref MUI_Button m_ok;
  override void BuildUI(notnull MUI_Runtime runtime)
  {
    ref MUI_Panel overlay = runtime.CreatePanel("overlay");
    overlay.MakeOverlay();
    overlay.GetStyle().m_Fill = Color.FromInt(0);
    ref MUI_Card card = runtime.CreateCard("card");
    card.SetWidth(560); card.SetPadding(28); card.SetAlign(0.5, 0.5);
    // Create* factories; AddChild; runtime.SetRoot(overlay);
  }
}
```

Consumer `chimeraMenus.conf` Layout: `{A1C47E92B6D8305F}UI/Layouts/MUI_BlankMenu.layout` (or `MUI_Resources.BLANK_MENU_LAYOUT`). `modded enum ChimeraMenuPreset { MyMenu }`.

HUD: `MUI_HudHost.Open` + `MakePassThroughOverlay`. No `MenuWithEditorContext`. Canvases must `IGNORE_CURSOR` (the host sets this).

## Custom widgets

`ref MyNode n = new MyNode(); runtime.Adopt(n); parent.AddChild(n);` plus `protected ref` if kept. Hooks: `MeasureIntrinsic`, `PaintForeground`, `OnClicked`, `OnDrag`, `WantsTextInput` / `GetEditText` / `SetEditTextFromBridge`, `HandleNavAxis`. Do not special-case classes in `MUI_InputRouter`.

## Layout pitfalls

Buttons in a row: Hug width + Grow 1 (default). Do **not** `SetFillWidth` on those buttons. Lists: `SetViewportHeight(h)` so cards/footers are not covered. Overlay center: `SetAlign(0.5, 0.5)`. `MUI_Card.Paint` ignores `SetFill` (command-uplink chrome).

Factories: `CreatePanel` `CreateLabel` `CreateButton` `CreateToggle` `CreateTextField` `CreateNumericField` `CreateScrollView` `CreateRow` `CreateSpacer` `CreateSurface` `CreateHeader` `CreateDivider` `CreateCard` `CreateFxBackdrop` `CreateLiveHeader` `CreateHairline` `CreateImage` `CreateProgress` `CreateSlider` `CreateTabs` `CreateDropdown` `Adopt`.
